- Number of new jobs detected.
- Duplicate rate.

Matching

- Percentage of jobs successfully analyzed.
- Percentage with extracted requirements.
- User-confirmed relevance.

Notification

- Emails successfully delivered.
- Relevant opportunities per digest.
- User interaction with recommendations.

System

- Job ingestion success rate.
- Processing time.
- API response time.
- Error rate.

